From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lkshrk <dev@harke.me>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:50:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Keep MCP secrets as environment references at user scope

apm install -g writes ${VAR} for Claude and env_vars, env_http_headers or bearer_token_env_var for Codex, never looks up or prompts for a value, refuses servers on adapters that would resolve a reference, and reports a runtime as configured only when it wrote the server.
